  m_text: "The Galaxy has been invaded by\nthe dreaded Antridians...\n\nThey have
    entered the peaceful system of\nZooma, making the inhabitants cower in fear.\n\nSince
    their mothership appeared, the Alliance of Planets \nhave seen their fleets depleted
    one by one.\n\nNow, in a desperate attempt to halt the incessant alien advance,\nthe
    mortally wounded Cruiser \"Malgatron\" releases its last hope. \n\nCommander,
    you must take control of the ZOOMANOID, and save the System.\n\nYou are the last
    hope..."
